-- Regulation W, 12 CFR 223.3(v) and 223.15: low-quality assets.
--
-- Target compiler: main (see NOTES.md).
-- Whether the member bank made an independent credit evaluation, approvals and notices are stated facts.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `regw-nouns`
IMPORT `regw-control`
IMPORT `regw-affiliate`
IMPORT `regwb-nouns`

§ `223.3(v): a low-quality asset`

-- "(1) An asset (including a security) classified as 'substandard,' 'doubtful,' or 'loss,' or treated as 'special
-- mention' or 'other transfer risk problems,' ...; (2) An asset in a nonaccrual status; (3) An asset on which
-- principal or interest payments are more than thirty days past due; (4) An asset whose terms have been
-- renegotiated or compromised due to the deteriorating financial condition of the obligor; and (5) An asset
-- acquired through foreclosure, repossession, or otherwise in satisfaction of a debt previously contracted, if
-- the asset has not yet been reviewed in an examination or inspection."
GIVEN c IS AN `Asset condition`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.3(v)
`is a low-quality asset` MEANS
       c's `classified or specially treated`
    OR c's `in nonaccrual status`
    OR c's `days past due` GREATER THAN 30
    OR c's `renegotiated because of deterioration`
    OR c's `acquired in satisfaction of a debt and not yet reviewed`

§ `223.15(b): renewals of loan participations involving problem loans`

-- (b)(3): "The participating member bank's share of the renewal or extension of additional credit does not exceed
-- its proportional share of the original transaction by more than 5 percent".  Two readings (NOTES.md): five
-- percentage points above the proportional share, or five percent more than the proportional share.
GIVEN
    share        IS A NUMBER
    proportional IS A NUMBER
    reading      IS A `Five percent reading`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.15(b)(3)
`share is within the five percent allowance` MEANS
    IF reading EQUALS `Five percentage points above the proportional share`
    THEN share MINUS proportional AT MOST 5
    ELSE share AT MOST proportional TIMES 105 DIVIDED BY 100

-- (b): "The prohibition contained in paragraph (a) of this section does not apply to the renewal of, or extension of
-- additional credit with respect to, a member bank's participation in a loan to a nonaffiliate that was originated
-- by an affiliate if: (1) The loan was not a low-quality asset at the time the member bank purchased its
-- participation; (2) The renewal or extension ... is approved, as necessary to protect the participating member
-- bank's investment ..., by the board of directors of the participating member bank or, if the originating affiliate
-- is a depository institution, by: (i) An executive committee of the board ...; or (ii) One or more senior
-- management officials ..., if: (A) The board ... approves standards ...; (B) Each renewal or extension ... meets
-- the standards; and (C) The board ... periodically reviews ...; (3) [the 5 percent allowance, unless] the member
-- bank obtains the prior written approval of its appropriate Federal banking agency; and (4) The participating member
-- bank provides its appropriate Federal banking agency with written notice ... not later than 20 days after
-- consummation."
GIVEN
    p       IS A `Participation renewal`
    reading IS A `Five percent reading`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.15(b)
`the renewal exception applies` MEANS
        p's `is such a renewal or extension`
    AND p's `the loan was not a low-quality asset when the bank bought its participation`
    AND approved
    AND (    `share is within the five percent allowance` (p's `the bank's share of the renewal`) (p's `the bank's proportional share of the original transaction`) reading
          OR p's `the appropriate Federal banking agency gave prior written approval`)
    AND p's `days from consummation to written notice` AT MOST 20
    WHERE
        approved MEANS
               p's `approved by the board of directors of the participating member bank`
            OR (    p's `the originating affiliate is a depository institution`
                AND (    p's `approved by an executive committee of the board`
                      OR (    p's `approved by one or more senior management officials`
                          AND p's `the board approved standards for such renewals`
                          AND p's `each renewal meets the standards`
                          AND p's `the board periodically reviews the renewals and the standards`)))

§ `223.15(a): the prohibition`

-- (a): "A member bank may not purchase a low-quality asset from an affiliate unless, pursuant to an independent
-- credit evaluation, the member bank had committed itself to purchase the asset before the time the asset was
-- acquired by the affiliate."  "asset" includes a security (223.3(v)(1)).  The seller is the person the member
-- bank deals with.
GIVEN
    s         IS A Structure
    r         IS A Readings
    t         IS A Transaction
    asset     IS AN `Asset condition`
    evaluated IS A BOOLEAN
    committed IS A BOOLEAN
    renewal   IS A `Participation renewal`
    reading   IS A `Five percent reading`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.15
`purchase of a low-quality asset is prohibited` MEANS
        (    t's `kind` EQUALS `A purchase of an asset`
          OR t's `kind` EQUALS `A purchase of, or an investment in, a security`)
    AND `is an affiliate` s r `Section 23A` (t's `with`)
    AND `is a low-quality asset` asset
    AND (NOT (evaluated AND committed))
    AND (NOT (`the renewal exception applies` renewal reading))
